\end{equation}

    \item \textbf{DistanÈ›a euclidianÄƒ} ($L_2$) cuantificÄƒ distanÈ›a geometricÄƒ directÄƒ dintre doi vectori, derivatÄƒ din teorema lui Pitagora:

\begin{equation}
